{"_doc":"Idioms of this series for this learning language (scripts/notes.py from scripts/idioms/<series>[_deck].txt). lem = lexicon keys (lowercase, space separated) matched in a row against gloss tokens; t = shown form; ko/en = short meaning; note_ko/note_en = optional one-line note; n = letters it appears in; first = [letter id, message index]. Patterns win over idioms, idioms over anchors.","lang":"ko","checked":false,"idioms":[{"lem":"마음 들다","t":"마음에 들","ko":"마음에 들다","en":"to like","note_ko":"‘마음에 들다’ 는 ‘좋아하다, 흡족하다’ 예요.","note_en":"마음에 들다 means “to be to one's liking”.","n":4,"first":["c2-l4",5]},{"lem":"생각 들다","t":"생각이 들지도","ko":"생각이 들다","en":"to feel, to think","n":1,"first":["p3",2]},{"lem":"잠 들다","t":"잠이 들면","ko":"잠이 들다","en":"to fall asleep","n":1,"first":["c1-l2",5]},{"lem":"어떻게 되다","t":"어떻게 될지","ko":"어떻게 되다","en":"to turn out","n":1,"first":["c4-l5",3]},{"lem":"한 번","t":"한 번","ko":"한 번","en":"once","n":2,"first":["c1-l6",5]},{"lem":"하루 종일","t":"하루 종일","ko":"하루 종일","en":"all day","n":4,"first":["c2-l2",0]},{"lem":"안 되다","t":"안 된다고","ko":"안 되다","en":"no good, must not","n":8,"first":["p3",0]},{"lem":"마음 아프다","t":"마음을 아프게","ko":"마음이 아프다","en":"to be heartbroken","n":4,"first":["c1-l5",4]},{"lem":"화 나다","t":"화가 난","ko":"화가 나다","en":"to get angry","n":2,"first":["c5-l1",0]},{"lem":"기분 좋다","t":"기분이 좋아","ko":"기분이 좋다","en":"to feel good","n":1,"first":["c5-l4",4]},{"lem":"눈 뜨다","t":"눈을 뜨니","ko":"눈을 뜨다","en":"to open one's eyes","n":1,"first":["p4",0]},{"lem":"꿈 꾸다","t":"꿈을 꾼","ko":"꿈을 꾸다","en":"to dream","n":1,"first":["c3-l6",5]},{"lem":"잘 알다","t":"잘 알잖아","ko":"잘 알다","en":"to know well","n":1,"first":["p1",1]},{"lem":"세상 떠나다","t":"세상을 떠났대","ko":"세상을 떠나다","en":"to pass away","n":2,"first":["c1-l2",0]}]}
